{"text":"And so even as we live in a world of terrible inequality, we're also proud to live in countries where even the grandson of a cook can become president, or even a dulut can help write a constitution, and even a T-cellar can become prime minister. The point is, is that the aim of our work must be not to just have a few do well, but to have everybody have a chance. Everybody who is willing to work for it, have the ability to dream big and then reach those dreams.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":1.0},{"text":"so","start":1.0,"end":1.22},{"text":"even","start":1.22,"end":1.58},{"text":"as","start":1.58,"end":1.92},{"text":"we","start":1.92,"end":2.12},{"text":"live","start":2.12,"end":2.4},{"text":"in","start":2.4,"end":2.96},{"text":"a","start":2.96,"end":3.08},{"text":"world","start":3.08,"end":3.3},{"text":"of","start":3.3,"end":3.74},{"text":"terrible","start":3.74,"end":4.78},{"text":"inequality","start":4.78,"end":6.0,"punct":","},{"text":"we're","start":6.66,"end":7.88},{"text":"also","start":7.88,"end":8.14},{"text":"proud","start":8.14,"end":8.86},{"text":"to","start":8.86,"end":9.1},{"text":"live","start":9.1,"end":9.22},{"text":"in","start":9.22,"end":9.46},{"text":"countries","start":9.46,"end":10.0},{"text":"where","start":10.0,"end":10.38},{"text":"even","start":10.38,"end":10.72},{"text":"the","start":10.72,"end":10.86},{"text":"grandson","start":10.86,"end":11.22},{"text":"of","start":11.22,"end":11.62},{"text":"a","start":11.62,"end":11.84},{"text":"cook","start":11.84,"end":11.9},{"text":"can","start":11.9,"end":12.16},{"text":"become","start":12.16,"end":12.42},{"text":"president","start":12.42,"end":12.8,"punct":","},{"text":"or","start":13.8,"end":14.18},{"text":"even","start":14.18,"end":14.36},{"text":"a","start":14.36,"end":14.8},{"text":"dulut","start":14.8,"end":15.16},{"text":"can","start":15.16,"end":15.44},{"text":"help","start":15.44,"end":15.86},{"text":"write","start":15.86,"end":16.04},{"text":"a","start":16.04,"end":16